g chain for the managed\n  posture (Branch A) is assigned to component **Llama Stack** (nearest owning\n  component for a RAG vector store, owned by RHOAI GenAI) pending creation of\n  a canonical component for the vector store. Flag for follow-up.\n- Platform Operator is in the canonical component list but has **no\n  architecture context file** — it is treated as an in-platform component\n  (canonical list membership) but its claims are unvalidated (see Health\n  Warnings).\n\n## Epic List\n\n### Main plan\n\n| ID | Title | Type | Team | Priority |\n|----|-------|------|------|----------|\n| RHAISTRAT-9007-E001 | Decide the first supported vector store posture (platform-managed vs external-connection-only) | Investigation | RHOAI GenAI | P0 |\n\n### Branch A — outcome: platform-managed (operator-deployed Milvus)\n\n| ID | Title | Type | Team | Priority |\n|----|-------|------|------|----------|\n| RHAISTRAT-9007-BRANCH-A-E002 | Midstream repo onboarding for the managed vector store (Milvus) | Implementation (repo-onboarding) | RHOAI GenAI | P0 |\n| RHAISTRAT-9007-BRANCH-A-E003 | License validation for Milvus and its transitive dependencies | Implementation (license-validation) | RHOAI GenAI | P0 |\n| RHAISTRAT-9007-BRANCH-A-E004 | Konflux onboarding for the midstream vector store repo | Implementation (konflux-onboarding) | RHOAI GenAI | P0 |\n| RHAISTRAT-9007-BRANCH-A-E005 | Platform Operator support for deploying the managed vector store | Implementation | RHOAI Platform Operator | P0 |\n| RHAISTRAT-9007-BRANCH-A-E006 | Llama Stack RAG provider integration for the managed vector store | Implementation | RHOAI GenAI | P1 |\n| RHAISTRAT-9007-BRANCH-A-E007 | Dashboard deploy-and-manage UI for the managed vector store | Implementation | RHOAI Dashboard | P1 |\n| RHAISTRAT-9007-BRANCH-A-E008 | Documentation for the platform-managed vector store posture | Implementation (docs-authoring) | RHOAI Documentation | P1 |\n\n### Branch B — outcome: external-connection-only\n