{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ac931fc2218ee1ea","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9007-BRANCH-B-E002\n3\ttitle: External vector store connection registration with validated connectivity\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9007\n5\tcomponent: Platform Operator\n6\tteam: RHOAI Platform Operator\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tbranch: B\n10\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9007-E001\n11\tdependencies:\n12\t- RHAISTRAT-9007-E001\n13\tgate_failure_impact:\n14\t  action: remove\n15\t  fallback_approach: If the platform-managed posture is chosen, this epic is removed\n16\t    and replaced by operator-deployed managed vector store work in the other branch.\n17\tai_signals:\n18\t  change_specificity: 0\n19\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n20\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n21\t  existing_foundation: 1\n22\t  open_questions: 0\n23\t  external_dependency: 0\n24\t  human_process_gates: 0\n25\t  repo_access: 1\n26\t  architecture_claims: 0\n27\timplementation_type: null\n28\tinvestigation_signals: null\n29\tai_implementability: High\n30\tai_implementability_score: 3\n31\tjira_key: null\n32\t---\n33\t# External vector store connection registration with validated connectivity\n34\t\n35\t## Description\n36\t\n37\tImplements the sanctioned way for data scientists to register an external\n38\tvector store connection per project with validated connectivity: a\n39\tplatform-managed connection resource that records the external store's\n40\tendpoint and credentials, validates reachability, and is consumable by\n41\tplatform components. This is the core external-path delivery for HLR-2 and\n42\texists only if the posture decision selects the external-connection-only\n43\tpath.\n44\t\n45\t## Scope\n46\t\n47\t- Implement per-project external vector store connection registration\n48\t  (resource shape, credential handling, and namespace/project scoping are\n49\t  design decisions for the implementing team).\n50\t- Implement connectivity validation at registration time: endpoint\n51\t  reachability and credential correctness are checked before the connection\n52\t  is accepted, with a clear validation result surfaced to the user.\n53\t- Store and expose connection metadata in a form that Llama Stack\n54\t  distributions and the Dashboard can consume.\n55\t- Keep credential handling consistent with the platform's existing\n56\t  secret/credential patterns.\n57\t\n58\t## Acceptance Criteria\n59\t\n60\t- A data scientist can register an external vector store connection in a\n61\t  project, supplying endpoint and credentials.\n62\t- Registration validates connectivity end-to-end; a connection that fails\n63\t  validation is rejected or flagged with a precise error.\n64\t- Connections are scoped per project and not visible across projects.\n65\t- Registered connections are discoverable by platform components (Llama\n66\t  Stack distributions, Dashboard) without manual config.\n67\t- Credential material is stored per the platform's secret-handling rules and\n68\t  never surfaced in plain text.\n69\t\n70\t## HLR Traceability\n71\t\n72\t- **HLR-2 (P0)**, external-path clause: \"data scientists can register an\n73\t  external vector store connection per project with validated connectivity.\"\n74\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-831cefdac8eb8373","agent_id":"aa7d072873bbf8959","session_id":"fcd3183f-6a69-447e-9701-c7744c4a517e","uuid":"590f592c-9c6d-472f-85f8-ea5f9c7fa061","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:49:00.102Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-ac931fc2218ee1ea","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9007 decomposition"}
