ctivity validation results (success and precise failure\n53\t  reasons) in the UI.\n54\t- Gate the surface behind the standard per-component feature flag mechanism\n55\t  (OdhDashboardConfig).\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- A user can create, edit, and delete an external vector store connection\n60\t  from the Dashboard, scoped to their project.\n61\t- Validation status and failure reasons are displayed accurately in the UI.\n62\t- Credential input is handled securely (masked, never echoed in plain text).\n63\t- The integration is behind a feature flag, default off until the external\n64\t  posture ships.\n65\t- The integration uses the Kubernetes API only, consistent with the Dashboard\n66\t  architecture context.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- **HLR-4 (P1)**: \"The Dashboard exposes the chosen integration (… connection\n71\t  management UI for the external path).\"\n72\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-831cefdac8eb8373","agent_id":"aa7d072873bbf8959","session_id":"fcd3183f-6a69-447e-9701-c7744c4a517e","uuid":"58eca832-7967-439b-acaf-1ea70777fa4c","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:49:01.909Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc5b57633addeff4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9007 decomposition"}
